apped comedian  chris rock in the face due to a joke  against his wife but that's not what  we're here to talk about because as  every year we'll briefly introduce you  to the most important winners of the  oscars this year koda won the award for  best picture the apple tv plus movie was  sent into the race for the most  important prize relatively late but then  it did win the oscar beforehand many  experts agreed that the netflix movie  the power of the dog had the best  chances of winning the prize but we're  wrong in the end however jane champion  won the award for best director for this  movie on the actor's side will smith for  king richard and jessica chastain for  the eyes of tammy faye cleaned up the  top prize in the best lead actor  category the best supporting actors were  troy kadzur for coda and ariana the bose  for west side story other winning movies  included encounter for best animated  film drive my car for best international  film and summer of seoul for best  documentary both westside story and  belfast were nominated in total of seven  categories but could win only one each  the winner of the evening however at  least by numbers was the science fiction  hit dune which took home six oscars the  categories include best's original score  best sound and best cinematography we  are curious to see when the sequel will  also celebrate success in the main  categories at the oscars in 2024  last tuesday sad news reached the  hollywood world bruce willis ends his  acting career this was announced by the  family of the 67 year old in a short  message the reason is said to be aphasia  which is a kind of speech disorder this  decision which the family made public  shortly after willa's birthday had been  considered carefully which is why it can  be assumed that the actor has been  suffering from the disease for some time  to this day bruce willis is primarily  associated with a die hard film series  which gave him his big breakthrough in  the 1980s he is considered one for  hollywood's biggest action stars even  though his last years were marked by  many b-movies either way he will sorely  be missed as an iconic actor and we wish  him all the best  many children of the 90s should be  familiar with his spy kids franchise  because the family movie by robert  rodriguez released in 2001 has become  iconic there are already a total of four  movies and even an animated series and  as we learned this week another movie is  currently in the planning stages as  deadline reports netflix is planning a  reboot of the children's movie series  and as with every previous movie  rodriguez will once again take a seat in  the director's chair together with him  netflix thus wants to race pockets to a  contemporary level which should  certainly please many in addition the 53  year old rodriguez is still the  screenwriter and producer of the movie  at the same time he and netflix have  also already proven that they can work  well together as the 2020 children's  superhero movie we can be heroes was  also directed by him of course we  shouldn't expect a familiar cast to  return as the titular spy kids after all  some of the kids from the first part are  already over 30 and don't quite pass for  kids anymore in any case we're looking  forward to robert rodriguez new spy kids  movie a release date is unfortunately  not yet known  only recently the news went through the  world that amazon has bought mgm it  looks like the first series project for  the comedy james bond series which now  also belongs to amazon is already  planned however double 07's row 2  million is not a story series about the  movies but a kind of reality tv in which  various candidates have the opportunity  to win a million pounds they have to  duel each other both physically and  mentally at well-known locations from  the franchise the selection process is  still underway so a start date is not  yet known the anticipation among fans  doesn't seem to be all that great  con